@startuml COMP-SEQ02
!include ../_theme.puml
title COMP-SEQ02 UC02 视频发现、搜索与播放（组件级）

actor "游客 / 普通用户" as User
participant "HomePage / VideoDetailPage" as Page
participant "videoApi / Axios" as Api
participant "Gin Router" as Router
participant "ListHandler / DetailHandler" as Handler
participant "ListVideoLogic / DetailVideoLogic" as Logic
database "MySQL" as DB
participant "静态媒体服务" as Media

User -> Page: 浏览或搜索视频
Page -> Api: videoApi.list(params)
Api -> Router: GET /api/v1/videos
Router -> Handler: ListHandler(context)
Handler -> Logic: List(VideoListReq)
Logic -> DB: 查询 status=approved、筛选、排序和分页
DB --> Logic: 视频及作者记录
Logic --> Handler: PageResult<VideoInfo>
Handler --> Api: HTTP 200
Api --> Page: 渲染视频列表或空状态

User -> Page: 打开目标视频
Page -> Api: videoApi.detail(id)
Api -> Router: GET /api/v1/videos/:id
Router -> Handler: DetailHandler(context)
Handler -> Logic: Detail(VideoDetailReq)
Logic -> DB: 校验 approved 并事务增加播放和每日统计
DB --> Logic: 视频、作者与评论计数
Logic --> Handler: VideoDetailInfo
Handler --> Api: HTTP 200 / 404
Api --> Page: 展示详情或错误
Page -> Media: GET /media/videos/:id/playlist.m3u8
Media --> Page: HLS 清单和分片 / 资源错误
@enduml
